    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f Please Note:</strong> <i>Locked In My Darkness is a short, narrative-driven walking sim with puzzle elements. It must be completed in a <strong>single sitting</strong>, and does <strong>not</strong> include a save system. Estimated playtime is between 40 minutes and 1 hour.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd73\ufe0f About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Locked In My Darkness</i> is a first-person psychological horror game set within the claustrophobic walls of a haunting apartment complex. You awaken in an unfamiliar space, surrounded by silence, dread, and the unsettling feeling that something is terribly wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you explore your surroundings, reality begins to shift\u2014walls bleed into a twisted <strong>red dimension</strong>, and the line between hallucination and truth blurs. With each step, you're drawn deeper into the darkness, piecing together clues and solving puzzles to uncover a way out... if there is one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cAfter playing through the Locked In My Darkness Demo, I am excited about this upcoming indie horror game.\u201d</i> \u2014 Lawod</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83e\udde0 Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Psychological Terror:</strong> A slow-burning, story-rich horror experience designed to keep you on edge. Expect disturbing imagery, a chilling atmosphere, and unsettling audio design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric World:</strong> Explore an apartment complex that transforms around you\u2014shifting between bleak realism and surreal horror as the story progresses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Puzzle-Driven Exploration:</strong> Search for hidden clues and solve light puzzles to progress through your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Single-Sitting Experience:</strong> The game is meant to be completed in one go, offering a compact but intense psychological horror experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No Combat, Just Dread:</strong> This is not a fast-paced horror shooter. The fear comes from what you see, what you hear\u2014and what you imagine might be waiting around the corner.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd34 Can you escape before the red consumes everything?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Face your fear. Discover the truth. But don\u2019t look back...</i></p>",
